OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785516478
OL,3,CHamas to disarm and Israel to withdraw
OL,4,Cfrom Gaza in new deal, Trump says
OL,6,FHamas is set to disarm and Israel to
OL,7,Fwithdraw its forces from Gaza under an
OL,8,Fagreement reached by US President
OL,9,FDonald Trump's Board of Peace late on
OL,10,FThursday.
OL,12,FDespite Trump's announcement,
OL,13,Fsignificant hurdles, conditions and
OL,14,Flengthy timelines remain before the
OL,15,Fwar in Gaza could come to an end, as
OL,16,Fneither Hamas nor Israel have yet
OL,17,Fresponded to the proposed deal.
OL,19,F"The agreement will be carried out in
OL,20,Fcarefully structured phases," Trump
OL,21,Fsaid on social media.
OL,26,@{D@AOU|D@]O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
