PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785516478
OL,3,CHamas to disarm and Israel to withdraw
OL,4,Cfrom Gaza in new deal, Trump says
OL,6,F"As disarmament is completed, Israeli
OL,7,Fforces will withdraw, and the
OL,8,FInternational Stabilisation Force will
OL,9,Fwork with a new Palestinian police
OL,10,Fforce to take responsibility for Gaza
OL,11,Fbeing safe for its residents and its
OL,12,Fneighbours."
OL,14,FThe Board of Peace hailed the
OL,15,Fagreement as a "historic breakthrough"
OL,16,Fand said that Hamas has agreed to a
OL,17,F"detailed roadmap for implementing the
OL,18,Fnext phases of the Gaza ceasefire".
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
