OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785516478
OL,3,CHamas to disarm and Israel to withdraw
OL,4,Cfrom Gaza in new deal, Trump says
OL,6,FIn a statement on social media
OL,7,Ffollowing the announcement, the Board
OL,8,Fof Peace's director-general, Nickolay
OL,9,FMladenov, said it had taken "months of
OL,10,Fvery difficult negotiations to get
OL,11,Fhere".
OL,13,FHe also admitted "there were several
OL,14,Fpoints when I did not believe we would
OL,15,Fmake it", adding that implementation
OL,16,Fand verification "have to be real" and
OL,17,Fthat "withdrawal must move in lockstep
OL,18,Fwith decommissioning".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
