OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785516478
OL,3,CHamas to disarm and Israel to withdraw
OL,4,Cfrom Gaza in new deal, Trump says
OL,6,FThe White House announcement comes
OL,7,Fnine months after a US-brokered
OL,8,Fceasefire was signed.
OL,10,FNegotiations between Israel and Hamas
OL,11,Fhad largely slowed over the
OL,12,Fimplementation of the agreement's
OL,13,Fsecond phase, including the
OL,14,Fdisarmament of Hamas, the withdrawal
OL,15,Fof Israeli forces and the
OL,16,Freconstruction of Gaza.
OL,18,FTrump's 20-point ceasefire plan calls
OL,19,Ffor Hamas to surrender its weapons and
OL,20,Fdismantle its extensive network of
OL,21,Ftunnels.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
