PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785516478
OL,3,CHamas to disarm and Israel to withdraw
OL,4,Cfrom Gaza in new deal, Trump says
OL,6,FThe proposal also pictures Israeli
OL,7,Fforces withdrawing from Gaza, the
OL,8,Finstallation of a technocratic
OL,9,FPalestinian government, the deployment
OL,10,Fof an international security force and
OL,11,Fthe reconstruction of the war-ravaged
OL,12,Fterritory.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
