CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785516478
OL,3,CHamas to disarm and Israel to withdraw
OL,4,Cfrom Gaza in new deal, Trump says
OL,6,FUS and Board of Peace officials,
OL,7,Fspeaking on condition of anonymity
OL,8,Funder White House ground rules, gave a
OL,9,Fhopeful assessment of the proposal,
OL,10,Fdescribing a framework similar to that
OL,11,Foutlined by Trump and his senior aides
OL,12,Fwhen the Board of Peace was
OL,13,Festablished to oversee the Gaza
OL,14,Fceasefire.
OL,16,FThe officials could not provide a
OL,17,Fspecific timetable for the disarmament
OL,18,Fof Hamas or other armed groups
OL,19,Foperating in Gaza, including
OL,20,FPalestinian Islamic Jihad.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
