PN,30907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785516479
OL,3,CHamas to disarm and Israel to withdraw
OL,4,Cfrom Gaza in new deal, Trump says
OL,6,FHowever, they said Gaza's police force
OL,7,Fwould hand over its weapons to the
OL,8,FBoard of Peace-backed technocratic
OL,9,Fadministration within the next two
OL,10,Fweeks.
OL,12,FThey also noted that the Gaza police
OL,13,Fforce does not include the vast
OL,14,Fmajority of Hamas fighters, and that
OL,15,Fheavy weapons are not covered by this
OL,16,Fstage of the agreement.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
