CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785516479
OL,3,CHamas to disarm and Israel to withdraw
OL,4,Cfrom Gaza in new deal, Trump says
OL,6,FInstead, the surrender of heavy
OL,7,Fweaponry and the dismantling of
OL,8,FHamas's tunnels and other military
OL,9,Finfrastructure would take place later
OL,10,Fin a process expected to last between
OL,11,F200 and 350 days, according to a Board
OL,12,Fof Peace official.
OL,14,FA US official said Israel, which has
OL,15,Flong been sceptical about Hamas'
OL,16,Fwillingness to disarm or relinquish
OL,17,Fits influence over Gaza, had been
OL,18,Fconsulted throughout the negotiations.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
