CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785516479
OL,3,CHamas to disarm and Israel to withdraw
OL,4,Cfrom Gaza in new deal, Trump says
OL,6,FThe official added that Israel was not
OL,7,Fbeing asked to do anything beyond the
OL,8,Fcommitments it had already made under
OL,9,FTrump's 20-point plan, namely
OL,10,Fwithdrawing its forces from Gaza and
OL,11,Fending airstrikes on the territory.
OL,13,FThey said that Trump would be "very,
OL,14,Fvery disappointed" if Israel did not
OL,15,Fhonour the agreement.
