OL,3,CHamas to disarm and Israel to withdraw
OL,4,Cfrom Gaza in new deal, Trump says
OL,6,FTrump met Israeli Prime Minister
OL,7,FBenjamin Netanyahu at the White House
OL,8,Fon Tuesday, although neither disclosed
OL,9,Fdetails of their first face-to-face
OL,10,Ftalks since the conflict with Iran
OL,11,Fbegan.
OL,13,FIsrael's mission to the United Nations
OL,14,Fdeclined to comment on the proposed
OL,15,Fagreement.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
