OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785516479
OL,3,CHamas to disarm and Israel to withdraw
OL,4,Cfrom Gaza in new deal, Trump says
OL,6,FThe official also described Iran as a
OL,7,Fpotential wildcard, saying Tehran had
OL,8,Furged Hamas not to accept the deal but
OL,9,Fwas currently unable to provide
OL,10,Fsignificant support because it was
OL,11,Ffocused on its conflict with the
OL,12,FUnited States.
OL,14,FHamas had previously insisted that the
OL,15,Ffirst phase of the ceasefire be fully
OL,16,Fimplemented before any disarmament
OL,17,Ftalks.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
