OL,3,CHamas to disarm and Israel to withdraw
OL,4,Cfrom Gaza in new deal, Trump says
OL,6,FThe group's founding charter calls for
OL,7,Farmed resistance against Israel, and
OL,8,Fit has been reluctant to surrender an
OL,9,Farsenal of rockets, anti-tank missiles
OL,10,Fand explosives that forms a central
OL,11,Fpart of its military capability.
OL,13,FHamas announced earlier this month,
OL,14,Fhowever, that it had dissolved its
OL,15,Fgovernment in Gaza and was preparing
OL,16,Fto transfer power to a technical
OL,17,Fcommittee backed by the United Nations
OL,18,Fas part of the ceasefire deal.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
